ucción)\";s:12:\"More actions\";s:13:\"Más acciones\";s:18:\"Hide sidebar panel\";b:1;s:19:\"Close sidebar panel\";b:1;s:13:\"all languages\";s:17:\"todos los idiomas\";s:20:\"Revision information\";s:28:\"Información de la revisión\";s:19:\"Create new revision\";s:21:\"Crear nueva revisión\";s:10:\"Last saved\";s:24:\"Guardado por última vez\";s:18:\"About text formats\";s:27:\"Acerca de formatos de texto\";s:63:\"Index this <em>@bundle</em> entity in sitemap <em>@sitemap</em>\";b:1;s:8:\"Priority\";s:9:\"Prioridad\";s:86:\"The priority this <em>@bundle</em> entity will have in the eyes of search engine bots.\";b:1;s:6:\"always\";s:7:\"siempre\";s:6:\"hourly\";b:1;s:5:\"daily\";s:11:\"diariamente\";s:6:\"weekly\";s:12:\"semanalmente\";s:7:\"monthly\";s:12:\"mensualmente\";s:6:\"yearly\";s:10:\"anualmente\";s:5:\"never\";s:5:\"nunca\";s:16:\"Change frequency\";s:20:\"Frecuencia de cambio\";s:138:\"The frequency with which this <em>@bundle</em> entity changes. Search engine bots may take this as an indication of how often to index it.\";b:1;s:14:\"Include images\";b:1;s:98:\"Determines if images referenced by this <em>@bundle</em> entity should be included in the sitemap.\";b:1;s:51:\"Regenerate all sitemaps after hitting <em>Save</em>\";b:1;s:48:\"Settings for this entity can be overridden here.\";b:1;s:35:\"Flag other translations as outdated\";s:44:\"Marcar las otras traducciones como obsoletas\";s:235:\"If you made a significant change, which means the other translations should be updated, you can flag all translations of this content as outdated. This will not change any other property of them, like whether they are published or not.\";s:241:\"Si hizo un cambio importante, que significa que las otras traducciones deben actualizarse, puede marcar todas las traducciones de este contenido como obsoleta. Esto no va a cambiar cualquier otra propiedad de ellas, como si se publican o no.\";s:10:\"Loading…\";s:11:\"Cargando…\";s:11:\"Authored by\";s:11:\"Escrito por\";s:27:\"Leave blank for %anonymous.\";s:29:\"Dejar vacío para %anonymous.\";s:11:\"Translation\";s:11:\"Traducción\";s:28:\"Generate automatic URL alias\";b:1;s:100:\"Uncheck this to create a custom alias below. <a href=\"@admin_link\">Configure URL alias patterns.</a>\";b:1;s:4:\"Date\";s:5:\"Fecha\";s:4:\"Time\";s:4:\"Hora\";s:11:\"Authored on\";s:17:\"Fecha de autoría\";s:21:\"Authoring information\";s:24:\"Información de autoría\";s:26:\"<em>Edit @type</em> @title\";s:28:\"<em>Editar @type</em> @title\";s:12:\"Edit @bundle\";b:1;s:9:\"Revisions\";s:10:\"Revisiones\";s:59:\"Select the types of paths for which to generate URL aliases\";b:1;s:46:\"Generate a URL alias for un-aliased paths only\";b:1;s:54:\"Update the URL alias for paths having an old URL alias\";b:1;s:36:\"Regenerate URL aliases for all paths\";b:1;s:36:\"Select which URL aliases to generate\";b:1;s:6:\"Update\";s:10:\"Actualizar\";s:222:\"Bulk generation can be used to generate URL aliases for items that currently have no aliases. This is typically used when installing Pathauto on a site that has existing un-aliased content that needs to be aliased in bulk.\";b:1;s:131:\"It can also be used to regenerate URL aliases for items that have an old alias and for which the Pathauto pattern has been changed.\";b:1;s:157:\"Note that this will only affect items which are configured to have their URL alias automatically set. Items whose URL alias is manually set are not affected.\";b:1;s:13:\"Initializing.\";s:14:\"Inicializando.\";s:22:\"An error has occurred.\";s:21:\"Ha ocurrido un error.\";s:51:\"Continue to <a href=\":error_url\">the error page</a>\";b:1;s:25:\"Bulk updating URL aliases\";b:1;s:29:\"Completed @current of @total.\";s:34:\"Se completaron @current de @total.\";s:29:\"Updated alias for %label @id.\";b:1;s:31:\"No new URL aliases to generate.\";b:1;s:53:\"The maximum number of media items have been selected.\";s:62:\"Se ha seleccionado el número máximo de elementos multimedia.\";s:13:\"Remove @label\";s:15:\"Eliminar @label\";s:6:\"Remove\";s:8:\"Eliminar\";s:13:\"Update widget\";s:22:\"Actualizar controlador\";s:287:\"Start typing the title of a piece of content to select it. You can also enter an internal path such as %add-node or an external URL such as %url. Enter %front to link to the front page. Enter %nolink to display link text only. Enter %button to display keyboard-accessible link text only.\";b:1;s:22:\"Opening media library.\";s:29:\"Abriendo librería de medios.\";s:17:\"Adding selection.\";s:21:\"Añadiendo selección\";s:16:\"Removing @label.\";s:18:\"Eliminando @label.\";s:125:\"Enter the YouTube URL. Valid URL formats include: http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1SqBdS0XkV4 and http://youtu.be/1SqBdS0XkV4.\";b:1;s:27:\"YouTube video ID: @video_id\";b:1;s:51:\"%name: The integer must be larger or equal to %min.\";s:61:\"%name: El número entero debe ser más grande o igual a %min.\";s:22:\"Promoted to front page\";s:35:\"Promocionado a la página principal\";s:22:\"Sticky at top of lists\";s:30:\"Fijo al comienzo de las listas\";s:30:\"@type %title has been updated.\";s:33:\"@type %title ha sido actualizado.\";s:21:\"@count min@count min\";b:1;s:24:\"@count hour@count hours\";s:24:\"@count hora@count horas\";s:22:\"@count day@count days\";s:24:\"@count día@count días\";s:10:\"no caching\";s:18:\"no poner en caché\";s:126:\"External resources can be optimized automatically, which can reduce both the size and number of requests made to your website.\";s:142:\"Los recursos externos pueden ser optimizados automáticamente, lo que reducirá tanto el tamaño como el número de peticiones a su sitio web.\";s:16:\"Clear all caches\";s:24:\"Vaciar todas las cachés\";s:11:\"Clear cache\";s:13:\"Vaciar caché\";s:35:\"Browser and proxy cache maximum age\";s:59:\"Antigüedad máxima de las caché del navegador y del proxy\";s:63:\"This is used as the value for max-age in Cache-Control headers.\";s:79:\"Esto se utiliza como el valor para max-age en los encabezados de Cache-Control.\";s:7:\"Caching\";s:6:\"Caché\";s:19:\"Aggregate CSS files\";s:21:\"Combinar archivos CSS\";s:26:\"Aggregate JavaScript files\";s:26:\"Juntar archivos JavaScript\";s:21:\"Minified Source HTML.\";b:1;s:31:\"Toggle minified HTML on or off.\";b:1;s:35:\"Strip comments from the source HTML\";b:1;s:83:\"If checked, strip HTML comments and multi-line comments in @script and @style tags.\";b:1;s:39:\"Disable minification for specific pages\";b:1;s:232:\"Specify pages by using their paths with leading forward slash. Enter one path per line. The \'*\' character is a wildcard. Example paths are %blog for the blog page and %blog-wildcard for every personal blog. %front is the front page.\";b:1;s:22:\"Bandwidth optimization\";s:31:\"Optimización de ancho de banda\";s:18:\"Save configuration\";s:22:\"Guardar configuración\";s:3:\"Fri\";s:3:\"Vie\";s:23:\"Show media item weights\";s:58:\"Muestra los pesos de los elementos de contenido multimedia\";s:43:\"Sitemaps can be regenerated on demand here.\";b:1;s:128:\"@indexed out of @total queue items have been processed.<br>Each sitemap is published after all of its items have been processed.\";b:1;s:13:\"Rebuild queue\";b:1;s:24:\"Rebuild queue & generate\";b:1;s:32:\"Progress of sitemap regeneration\";b:1;s:14:\"Sitemap status\";b:1;s:7:\"Sitemap\";s:14:\"Mapa del sitio\";s:4:\"Type\";s:4:\"Tipo\";s:6:\"Status\";s:6:\"Estado\";s:10:\"Link count\";b:1;s:18:\"published on @time\";b:1;s:8:\"disabled\";s:11:\"desactivado\";s:11:\"Add sitemap\";b:1;s:5:\"Types\";s:5:\"Tipos\";s:14:\"Secondary tabs\";s:19:\"Solapas secundarias\";s:38:\"Include this sitemap during generation\";b:1;s:111:\"The sitemap ID will be part of the URL and can only contain lowercase letters, numbers, dashes and underscores.\";b:1;s:12:\"Sitemap type\";b:1;s:107:\"The sitemap\'s type defines its looks and content. Sitemaps types can be configured <a href=\"@url\">here</a>.\";b:1;s:26:\"Administrative description\";s:27:\"Descripción administrativa\";s:24:\"@count week@count weeks\";s:28:\"@count semana@count semanas\";s:40:\"Regenerate the sitemaps during cron runs\";b:1;s:81:\"Uncheck this if you intend to only regenerate the sitemaps manually or via drush.\";b:1;s:17:\"On every cron run\";b:1;s:27:\"Sitemap generation interval\";b:1;s:57:\"The sitemap will be generated according to this interval.\";b:1;s:35:\"Add styling and sorting to sitemaps\";b:1;s:156:\"If checked, sitemaps will be displayed as tables with sortable entries and thus become much friendlier towards human visitors. Search engines will not care.\";b:1;s:13:\"Hide branding\";b:1;s:90:\"Remove the \'Generated by the Simple XML Sitemap Drupal module\' string from the XSL output.\";b:1;s:30:\"Remove hreflang markup in HTML\";b:1;s:236:\"Google recommends displaying hreflang definitions either in the HTML markup or in the sitemap, but not in both places.<br>If checked, hreflang definitions created by the language module will be removed from the markup reducing its size.\";b:1;s:30:\"Skip non-existent translations\";b:1;s:373:\"If checked, entity links are generated exclusively for languages the entity has been translated to as long as the language is not excluded below.<br>Otherwise entity links are generated for every language installed on the site apart from languages excluded below.<br>Bear in mind that non-entity paths like homepage will always be generated for every non-excluded language.\";b:1;s:17:\"Exclude languages\";b:1;s:60:\"There will be no links generated for languages checked here.\";b:1;s:17:\"Language settings\";s:18:\"Opciones de idioma\";s:15:\"Default sitemap\";b:1;s:181:\"This sitemap will be available under <em>/sitemap.xml</em> in addition to its default path <em>/variant-name/sitemap.xml</em>.<br>Sitemaps can be configured <a href=\"@url\">here</a>.\";b:1;s:16:\"Default base URL\";s:20:\"URL base por defecto\";s:206:\"On some hosting providers it is impossible to pass parameters to cron to tell Drupal which URL to bootstrap with. In this case the base URL of sitemap links can be overridden here.<br>Example: <em>@url</em>\";b:1;s:23:\"Exclude duplicate links\";b:1;s:106:\"Prevent per-sitemap duplicate links.<br>Unchecking this may help avoiding PHP memory errors on huge sites.\";b:1;s:26:\"Maximum links in a sitemap\";b:1;s:379:\"The maximum number of links one sitemap can hold. If more links are generated than set here, a sitemap index will be created and the links split into several sub-sitemaps.<br>50 000 links is the maximum Google will parse per sitemap, but choosing a lower value may be needed to avoid PHP memory errors on huge sites.<br>If left blank, all links will be shown on a single sitemap.\";b:1;s:31:\"Sitemap generation max duration\";b:1;s:245:\"The maximum duration <strong>in seconds</strong> the generation task can run during a single cron run or during one batch process iteration.<br>The higher the number, the quicker the generation process, but higher the risk of PHP timeout errors.\";b:1;s:23:\"Entities per queue item\";b:1;s:160:\"The number of entities to process in each queue item.<br>Increasing this number will use more memory but will result in less queries improving generation speed.\";b:1;s:17:\"Advanced settings\";s:18:\"Opciones avanzadas\";s:25:\"Default sitemap generator\";b:1;s:20:\"Custom URL generator\";b:1;s:20:\"Entity URL generator\";b:1;s:23:\"Menu link URL generator\";b:1;s:23:\"Arbitrary URL generator\";b:1;s:23:\"Sitemap index generator\";b:1;s:21:\"Sitemap URL generator\";b:1;s:17:\"Sitemap generator\";b:1;s:14:\"URL generators\";b:1;s:16:\"Add sitemap type\";b:1;s:90:\"Sitemaps of this type will be built according to the sitemap generator plugin chosen here.\";b:1;s:91:\"Sitemaps of this type will be populated with URLs generated by these URL generator plugins.\";b:1;s:11:\"Entity type\";s:15:\"Tipo de entidad\";s:15:\"Indexed bundles\";b:1;s:26:\"Excluded from all sitemaps\";b:1;s:9:\"Configure\";s:10:\"Configurar\";s:195:\"Simple XML Sitemap settings will be added only to entity forms of entity types enabled here. Settings for specific entity bundles (e.g. <em>page</em>) can be adjusted here or on the bundle pages.\";b:1;s:8:\"Entities\";s:9:\"Entidades\";s:12:\"Custom links\";s:22:\"Enlaces personalizados\";s:75:\"Do not index entities of type <em>@bundle</em> in sitemap <em>@sitemap</em>\";b:1;s:68:\"Index entities of type <em>@bundle</em> in sitemap <em>@sitemap</em>\";b:1;s:79:\"The priority entities of this type will have in the eyes of search engine bots.\";b:1;s:132:\"The frequency with which entities of this type change. Search engine bots may take this as an indication of how often to index them.\";b:1;s:91:\"Determines if images referenced by entities of this type should be included in the sitemap.\";b:1;s:13:\"Vertical Tabs\";s:20:\"Pestañas verticales\";s:28:\"Configure %label entity type\";b:1;s:42:\"The configuration options have been saved.\";s:47:\"Se han guardado las opciones de configuración.\";s:15:\"Initializing...\";s:16:\"Inicializando...\";s:106:\"The generation failed to finish. It can be continued manually on the module\'s settings page, or via drush.\";b:1;s:23:\"Generating XML sitemaps\";b:1;s:107:\"Processing items from the queue.<br>Each sitemap gets published after all of its items have been processed.\";b:1;s:61:\"@indexed out of @total total queue items have been processed.\";b:1;s:68:\"%bundle_label <span class=\"description\">(sitemaps: %sitemaps)</span>\";b:1;s:83:\"If a custom link points to an entity, include its referenced images in the sitemap.\";b:1;s:54:\"Add custom internal drupal paths to specific sitemaps.\";b:1;s:347:\"Specify drupal internal (relative) paths, one per line. Do not forget to prepend the paths with a \'/\'.<br>Optionally link priority <em>(0.0 - 1.0)</em> can be added by appending it after a space.<br> Optionally link change frequency <em>(always / hourly / daily / weekly / monthly / yearly / never)</em> can be added by appending it after a space.\";b:1;s:215:\"<strong>Examples:</strong><br><em>/ 1.0 daily</em> -> home page with the highest priority and daily change frequency<br><em>/contact</em> -> contact page with the default priority and no change frequency information\";b:1;s:12:\"Sitemap file\";s:26:\"Archivo del mapa del sitio\";s:63:\"Generated by the <a href=\"@url\">@module_name</a> Drupal module.\";b:1;s:32:\"Number of sitemaps in this index\";s:41:\"Número de mapas de sitio en este índice\";s:11:\"Sitemap URL\";s:22:\"URL del mapa del sitio\";s:22:\"Last modification date\";s:30:\"Última fecha de modificación\";s:30:\"Number of URLs in this sitemap\";s:38:\"Cantidad de URL en este mapa del sitio\";s:12:\"URL location\";s:16:\"Ubicacion de URL\";s:15:\"Translation set\";s:23:\"Conjunto de traducción\";s:6:\"Images\";s:9:\"Imágenes\";s:34:\"Inherits meta tags from: @inherits\";s:33:\"Meta tags heredados de: @inherits\";s:6:\"Active\";s:6:\"Activo\";s:6:\"Revert\";s:8:\"Revertir\";s:85:\"Configure global meta tag default values below. Meta tags may be left as the default.\";s:140:\"Configure los valores predeterminados de las etiquetas meta globales a continuación. Las metaetiquetas pueden dejarse como predeterminadas.\";s:205:\"Meta tag patterns are passed down from one level to the next unless they are overridden. To view a summary of the individual meta tags and the pattern for a specific configuration, click on its name below.\";b:1;s:189:\"If the top-level configuration is not specific enough, additional default meta tag configurations can be added for a specific entity type or entity bundle, e.g. for a specific content type.\";s:264:\"Si la configuración de nivel superior no es lo suficientemente específica, se pueden añadir configuraciones de metaetiquetas por defecto para un tipo específico de entidad o colección de campos de entidades, por ejemplo, para un tipo específico de contenido.\";s:173:\"Meta tags can be further refined on a per-entity basis, e.g. for individual nodes, by adding the \"Metatag\" field to that entity type through its normal field settings pages.\";s:218:\"Las metaetiquetas se pueden refinar aún más para cada entidad, por ejemplo, para nodos individuales, añadiendo el campo \"Metatag\" a ese tipo de entidad a través de sus páginas de configuración de campos normales.\";s:21:\"Add default meta tags\";s:29:\"Añadir meta tags por defecto\";}',-1,1777749166.408,1,'locale','0'),('locale:es::anonymous',_binary 'a:132:{s:4:\"True\";s:6:\"Verdad\";s:16:\"Published status\";s:22:\"Estado de publicación\";s:19:\"@field_name: @label\";s:19:\"@field_name: @label\";s:13:\"Taxonomy term\";s:22:\"Término de taxonomía\";s:6:\"Rating\";s:9:\"Votación\";s:6:\"Rights\";s:8:\"Derechos\";s:13:\"Cache control\";b:1;s:6:\"Robots\";s:6:\"Robots\";s:23:\"Geographical place name\";s:28:\"Nombre del lugar geográfico\";s:5:\"Image\";s:5:\"Image\";s:6:\"Pragma\";b:1;s:19:\"Geographical region\";s:19:\"Región geográfica\";s:7:\"Refresh\";s:10:\"Actualizar\";s:11:\"Description\";s:12:\"Descripción\";s:8:\"Abstract\";s:7:\"Resumen\";s:10:\"Set cookie\";b:1;s:21:\"Geographical position\";s:21:\"Posición geográfica\";s:15:\"Referrer policy\";s:23:\"Política de remitentes\";s:13:\"Revisit After\";b:1;s:15:\"Original source\";s:15:\"Fuente original\";s:6:\"Author\";s:5:\"Autor\";s:6:\"Google\";s:6:\"Google\";s:9:\"Generator\";s:9:\"Generador\";s:10:\"Page title\";s:21:\"Título de la página\";s:13:\"Next page URL\";b:1;s:13:\"Canonical URL\";s:13:\"URL canónica\";s:7:\"Expires\";s:6:\"Expira\";s:17:\"Previous page URL\";b:1;s:4:\"ICBM\";s:4:\"ICBM\";s:13:\"Shortlink URL\";s:9:\"URL corta\";s:8:\"Keywords\";s:14:\"Palabras clave\";s:9:\"Image URL\";s:13:\"URL de imagen\";s:6:\"Gender\";s:7:\"Género\";s:6:\"Series\";s:6:\"Series\";s:10:\"Image type\";s:14:\"Tipo de imagen\";s:8:\"Page URL\";s:14:\"URL de página\";s:11:\"Video width\";s:14:\"Ancho de video\";s:10:\"Video type\";s:15:\"Tipo del vídeo\";s:19:\"Alternative locales\";s:38:\"Configuraciones de idiom