red until @date','','none'),(7915,_binary '<a href=\":update_status_report\">Update to a supported minor</a> as soon as possible to continue receiving security updates.','','none'),(7916,_binary 'Manages breakpoints and breakpoint groups for responsive designs.','','11.3.8'),(7917,_binary 'Allows users to comment on content.','','11.3.8'),(7918,_binary 'Allows users to translate configuration text.','','11.3.8'),(7919,_binary 'Provides site-wide contact forms and forms to contact individual users.','','11.3.8'),(7920,_binary 'Allows users to translate content.','','11.3.8'),(7921,_binary 'Provides contextual links to directly access tasks related to page elements.','','11.3.8'),(7922,_binary 'Logs system events in the database.','','11.3.8'),(7923,_binary 'Caches pages, including those with dynamic content, for all users.','','11.3.8'),(7924,_binary 'Provides a user interface for the Field module.','','11.3.8'),(7925,_binary 'Defines a field type for image media and provides display configuration tools.','','11.3.8'),(7926,_binary 'Allows users to configure available languages.','','11.3.8'),(7927,_binary 'Allows users to create menu links.','','11.3.8'),(7928,_binary 'Users with sufficient access rights will be able to override these options.','','11.3.8'),(7929,_binary 'Caches pages for anonymous users and can be used when external page cache is not available.','','11.3.8'),(7930,_binary 'Allows users to create search pages based on plugins provided by other modules.','','11.3.8'),(7931,_binary 'PHP APCu caching','','11.3.8'),(7932,_binary 'Enabled (@size)','','none'),(7933,_binary 'Depending on your configuration, Drupal can run with a @apcu_size APCu limit. However, a @apcu_default_size APCu limit (the default) or above is recommended, especially if your site uses additional custom or contributed modules.','','none'),(7934,_binary 'Memory available: @available.','','none'),(7935,_binary 'PHP APCu caching can improve your site\'s performance considerably. It is <