on</em>.','','11.3.8'),(10281,_binary 'Verify that permissions are correct for your site\'s roles, including the generic <em>Anonymous user</em> and <em>Authenticated user</em>. In order to use personal contact forms, users need both <em>View user information</em> (in the <em>User</em> section, which enables them to view user profiles) and <em>Use users\' personal contact forms</em> (in the <em>Contact</em> section, which enables them to use contact forms if they can view user profiles).','','11.3.8'),(10282,_binary 'About searching','','11.3.8'),(10283,_binary 'If checked, multiple values for this field will be shown in the same row. If not checked, each value in this field will create a new row. If using group by, make sure to group by \"Entity ID\" for this setting to have any effect.','','11.3.8'),(10284,_binary 'Converts an image to AVIF, with a fallback if AVIF is not supported.','','11.3.8'),(10285,_binary 'Contact block','','11.3.8'),(10286,_binary 'The content block language code.','','11.3.8'),(10287,_binary 'Add %type content block','','11.3.8'),(10288,_binary 'Content block ID','','11.3.8'),(10289,_binary 'The human-readable name for this block type, displayed on the <em>Block types</em> page.','','11.3.8'),(10290,_binary 'Displays on the <em>Block types</em> page.','','11.3.8'),(10291,_binary 'Block type %label has been added.','','11.3.8'),(10292,_binary 'There was a problem creating field @label: @message','','11.3.8'),(10293,_binary 'Edit content block %label','','11.3.8'),(10294,_binary 'You need to select a field type.','','11.3.8'),(10295,_binary 'Form display','','11.3.8'),(10296,_binary 'The website encountered an unexpected error. Try again later.','','11.3.8'),(10297,_binary 'The website encountered an unexpected error. Try again later.','','11.3.8'),(10298,_binary 'Enter the YouTube URL. Valid URL formats include: http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1SqBdS0XkV4 and http://youtu.be/1SqBdS0XkV4.','','11.3.8'),(10299,_binary 'Embedded video for @enti