es on the permissions admin page, please see the included README.txt file for details.','','11.3.8'),(10538,_binary 'Provides support for applinks.org meta tags.','','11.3.8'),(10539,_binary 'Provides support to define and manage custom meta tags.','','11.3.8'),(10540,_binary 'Provides the fifteen <a href=\"https://dublincore.org/documents/dces/\">Dublin Core Metadata Element Set 1.1</a> meta tags from the <a href=\"https://dublincore.org/\">Dublin Core Metadata Institute</a>.','','11.3.8'),(10541,_binary 'Provides forty additional meta tags from the <a href=\"https://dublincore.org/\">Dublin Core Metadata Institute</a>.','','11.3.8'),(10542,_binary 'A set of meta tags specially for controlling advanced functionality with Facebook.','','11.3.8'),(10543,_binary 'Provides support for many different favicons.','','11.3.8'),(10544,_binary 'Provides support for meta tags used for Google Custom Search Engine.','','11.3.8'),(10545,_binary 'Provides support for the hreflang meta tag with some extra logic to simplify it.','','11.3.8'),(10546,_binary 'Provides support for meta tags used to control the mobile browser experience.','','11.3.8'),(10547,_binary 'Provides support for Open Graph Protocol meta tags.','','11.3.8'),(10548,_binary 'Provides additional Open Graph Protocol meta tags for describing products.','','11.3.8'),(10549,_binary 'Provides metatag support for Page Manager variants.','','11.3.8'),(10550,_binary 'Provides support for Pinterest\'s custom meta tags.','','11.3.8'),(10551,_binary 'Provides support for Twitter\'s Card meta tags.','','11.3.8'),(10552,_binary 'Verifies ownership of a site for search engines and other services.','','11.3.8'),(10553,_binary 'Provides views integration for metatags.','','11.3.8'),(10554,_binary 'Minify the contents of the Drupal page','','11.3.8'),(10555,_binary 'Enhance security of your Drupal website.','','11.3.8'),(10556,_binary 'Limit simultaneous user sessions.','','11.3.8'),(10557,_binary 'Generates standard-compliant hre