vidual basis.','','none'),(11029,_binary 'The URL of an video which should represent the content. For best results use a source that is at least 1200 x 630 pixels in size, but at least 600 x 316 pixels is a recommended minimum. Object types supported include video.episode, video.movie, video.other, and video.tv_show.','','none'),(11030,_binary '[current-page:url]','','11.3.8'),(11031,_binary '[node:url]','','11.3.8'),(11032,_binary '[term:url]','','11.3.8'),(11033,_binary '[user:url]','','11.3.8'),(11034,_binary 'Schema.org Metatag is installed','','none'),(11035,_binary 'The <a href=\"@module\">Schema.org Metatag</a> module is installed.','','none'),(11036,_binary 'URL for a version of this page in %langcode','','none'),(11037,_binary 'Links a book to an author\'s Facebook profile, should be either URLs to the author\'s profile page or their Facebook profile IDs.','','none'),(11038,_binary 'The Book\'s ISBN','','none'),(11039,_binary 'The date the book was released.','','none'),(11040,_binary 'Book tag(s)','','11.3.8'),(11041,_binary 'The URL of an image which should represent the content. The image must be at least 200 x 200 pixels in size; 600 x 316 pixels is a recommended minimum size, and for best results use an image least 1200 x 630 pixels in size. Supports PNG, JPEG and GIF formats. Should not be used if og:image:url is used. Note: if multiple images are added many services (e.g. Facebook) will default to the largest image, not specifically the first one.','','none'),(11042,_binary 'The URL of media which should represent the content.','','none'),(11043,_binary 'No hover','','none'),(11044,_binary 'Do not show hovering Save or Search buttons, generated by the Pinterest browser extensions.','','none'),(11045,_binary 'Do not pin anything from this page. When selected, this option will take precedence over all options below.','','none'),(11046,_binary 'No search','','none'),(11047,_binary 'Do not allow Pinterest visual search to happen from this page.','','none